  message: "Closed by PR merged as dev 24c52b5c94 (WI-bosog). AR-record repo_fingerprint field now sha256:<64hex> (was bare-64), uniform scheme prefix with run_signature/config_fingerprint. Prefix applied at the field-render site (compute_repo_fingerprint_field, stamped in finalize) so the bare digest stays colon-safe for the cache-dir path segment. repo_fingerprint_scheme v1->v2. BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE: 126 tests green across test_repo_fingerprint (3 new field-rendering tests + existing bare-digest tests) / test_finalize / test_run_behavior_map / test_cli_run_behavior_map / test_behavior_map_schema, all asserting the sha256:-prefixed field; new helper at 100% coverage; spec §id + CHANGELOG updated; no other scheme pin or repo_fingerprint format assertion left on v1. Bridge item for G8 (settles fingerprint FORMAT)."  # 8c8c
